  m_Text: "G\xF6revler gece yar\u0131s\u0131 yenilenir. Sand\u0131k \xFC\xE7 g\xF6rev bitince a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; i\xE7inden Coin, toz, yem ya da recipe \xE7\u0131kar.\nSeri: her g\xFCn sand\u0131\u011F\u0131 al\u0131rsan b\xFCy\xFCr, bir g\xFCn ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131rsan biraz geri d\xFC\u015Fer."
